    "finding": "Only 0.554% of held-out features changed. The model reduced error on those changes by 42%, but its total state error was 6.5 times the copy-state baseline.",
    "limitations": [
      "The model predicts symbolic observations rather than pixels.",
      "It does not plan or control the agent.",
      "It failed to beat zero-reward and always-alive baselines.",
      "The replay policy is random."
